-- table: Aggregated EUX Results
-- name: Average EUX Score (Weighted)
-- format:
-- description: NEW 1.1.0.2. Display text of Average EUX Score Weighted Value. Bind a card to this to use count-weighted averaging; the legacy measure is untouched.
VAR v = [Average EUX Score Weighted Value]
RETURN
    IF ( ISBLANK ( v ), "No Data", FORMAT ( v, "0.00" ) )
